116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Every project begins with simple sketches and ideas, allowing creativity to take the lead. As the design process progresses, these initial concepts are refined and validated through the application of calculus and physics, ensuring their feasibility and functionality.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6 7 8]
>>
