155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The primary focus is on passenger service, which is why the enhanced operation for dense urban environments was a guiding principle in the design. This allows the aircraft to efficiently serve modern cities, connecting business districts to airports and other tourist attractions, while ensuring safety during emergency landings on vertiports located atop buildings. Additionally, the aircraft is capable of executing emergency landings at short STOL airports.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
