158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A preliminary estimate is made of how long each stage can take and the estimated consumption time. It is observed that the stage with the highest consumption will be the takeoff and vertical landing, although they last the shortest time, these stages require a peak discharge at a high rate.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
