170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (One of the challenges of this innovative transportation technology is the training of the pilots, besides using top of the line avionics to reduce the workload during the flight \(Garmin 3000\), we included a place for a co-pilot to get real life experience. this is a must for our safety considerations based on skills and qualifications. )
/E (One of the challenges of this innovative transportation technology is the training of the pilots, besides using top of the line avionics to reduce the workload during the flight \(Garmin 3000\), we included a place for a co-pilot to get real life experience. this is a must for our safety considerations based on skills and qualifications. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
