/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Li-Ion battery system is currently the best available energy storage technology, renowned for its high energy density and ability to deliver high currents. The battery packs are composed of individual cells that can be arranged in almost any shape to suit the system's requirements. We partnered  the MGM COMPRO team that is able to provide the optimal solution with the balance between energy density and C-rate.)
/E (The Li-Ion battery system is currently the best available energy storage technology, renowned for its high energy density and ability to deliver high currents. The battery packs are composed of individual cells that can be arranged in almost any shape to suit the system's requirements. We partnered  the MGM COMPRO team that is able to provide the optimal solution with the balance between energy density and C-rate.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
